<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept edible oil imports down 27.4 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept edible oil imports down 27.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of edible oil in the first nine months were 2.04 million tonnes, down 27.4 percent from the same period last year, the Futures Herald said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Imports of edible oil were 180,000 tonnes in September alone, the newspaper said.</p>
</text>
